# Upstream MediaWiki ignores everything under skins/ so a fresh checkout
# can drop in third-party skins without polluting the repo. HDP ships a
# fixed set of skins vendored into the repo — whitelist them explicitly
# so contributors don't need `git add -f` for edits under these dirs.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.vsls.json
!/README
!/BlueSpiceDiscovery/
!/hdp/
!/MinervaNeue/
!/MonoBook/
!/Timeless/
!/Vector/
